  "2026-11-05T13:39:33.129Z",codex-agent,"Final source commit 389a1f6 passed npm run release:check and bun run release:check: 14/14 stages each, 42/42 suite tests each with zero failures/skips; 1/1 packed test with two journeys and 4/4 restored regressions each; all five behavioral reverts fail as intended. Independent production coverage: 428/428 statements, 275/275 branches, 108/108 functions, 362/362 lines across nine modules. Zero lint violations, clone pairs and production audit vulnerabilities; 63 declarations documented. Separate Node 22.19.0 and 26.13.0 packed tests passed both npm/npx and native Bun/bunx journeys with Git absent. All four captures have the same SHA-256 and 43 allowlisted files. Both OS-writer runs acknowledged and preserved 17 writes with three explicit conflicts out of 20. Machine-readable receipts and addressed SDK quirks are in docs/verification.json."
